    "id": "guide-spirograph-rose",
    "name": "指南 · Rose Curve",
    "description": "保留指南 R=150、r=75、笔距 75；源运动学下退化为直线，不替换为花瓣曲线。",
    "reference": {
      "url": "https://www.mathartstudio.art/guide/spirograph",
      "section": "玫瑰曲线（Rose Curve）",
